 "applies_to": "Fume hoods controlled and monitored by the Johnson Controls HMS-2000 touchscreen fume hood controller with face velocity, sash, pressure and airflow inputs.",
 "summary": "The HMS-2000 is a touchscreen fume hood controller and monitor that holds hood face velocity by driving the exhaust valve or damper, with occupied, unoccupied and standby modes. It connects to the BAS over BACnet MS/TP and exposes its four analog and digital inputs, outputs and relays, the input setpoints, alarm and warning limits, overrides and alarm states.",
 "bacnet_transport": [
  "BACnet MS/TP"
 ],
