 "default_device_instance": "85000 + MS/TP MAC address",
 "access_inferred": false,
 "notes": [
  "The guide lists each object with a functional description, not an Object_Name string; that description is used as the point name here.",
  "Objects marked \"Not used\" in the guide (AV 5-10, 35-42, 45, 46, 48-53, 62, 63 and MV 2, 4, 9) are left out.",
  "What AI 1-4 measure depends on how each input is configured; the names give the factory default use.",
  "Operating mode (MV 1) covers occupied, unoccupied and standby (decommissioned) modes; the guide does not print the state numbers.",
  "Units are not printed in the BACnet table."
 ],
